@end iftex 
random variable, with @math{a,b>0}. To make use of this function, write first @code{load("distrib")}.

The shape parameter is @math{a}, and the scale parameter is @math{b}.

The pdf is
@html
$$
f(x; a, b) = {x^{a-1}e^{-x/b}\over b^a \Gamma(a)}
$$
@end html
@ifinfo

@example
                    a - 1   - x/b
                   x      %e      unit_step(x)
      f(x, a, b) = ---------------------------
                                     a
                           gamma(a) b
@end example

