@end ifinfo
@iftex
@math{{\it Cauchy}(a,b)}
@end iftex 
random variable, with @math{b>0}. To make use of this function, write first @code{load("distrib")}.

The pdf is
@html
$$
f(x; a, b) = {b\over \pi\left((x-a)^2+b^2\right)}
$$
@end html
@ifinfo

@example
                            b
      f(x, a, b) = -------------------
                               2    2
                   %pi ((x - a)  + b )
@end example

@end ifinfo
@tex
$$f(x; a, b) = {b\over \pi\left((x-a)^2+b^2\right)}$$
@end tex

